  "holistic_F_N": 2,
  "holistic_F_H": -1,
  "section_notes": "S2 sets a 7% permanent limit with no sales stop, and per-model results go only to regulators, which weakens the customer protection the answer key requires. S5 makes recall mandatory above 8 per 100,000 per model with an effective-remedy option, and S1 requires 24-hour reporting of all thermal incidents, including suspected ones. S3 and S4 sit within the acceptable ranges, with a six-year retrofit and built-in suppression from 36 months."
